  "description": "Export configuration key probes (export-plan-compiler.md section 4, R-091, decision 093): one undocumented key in a channel, an exportList entry, a filter, the parameters object, an exportParameters entry and a preset, beside the valid configuration they change. Each probe step names an authored export configuration (the recorder's preset uzp_recorder, PNG 16, no dithering, infinite padding, root paths s0 and s1, changed as the probe says); the recorder lists it with list_project_textures and, when that succeeds, exports it, recording Painter's answer or refusal, the directory content and the files.",
